.TH DUB-CLEAN 1 "2026-08-16" "The D Language Foundation" "The D Language Foundation"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dub-clean \- Removes intermediate build files and cached build results
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdub clean \fR[<\fIpackage\fR>] \fIOPTIONS\&.\&.\&.\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command removes any cached build files of the given package(s). The final target file, as well as any copyFiles are currently not removed.

Without arguments, the package in the current working directory will be cleaned.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-all\-packages\fR
.RS 4
Cleans up *all* known packages (dub list)
.RE
.SS COMMON OPTIONS
See \fBdub\fR(1)
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.TP
.BR 0
DUB succeeded
.TP
.BR 1
usage errors, unknown command line flags
.TP
.BR 2
package not found, package failed to load, miscellaneous error
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
\fIdub\&.sdl\fR, \fIdub\&.json\fR
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Copyright (c) 1999-2026 by The D Language Foundation
.SH ONLINE DOCUMENTATION
.URhttp://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
http://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
.UE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdub\fR(1), \fBdub-clean-caches\fR(1), \fBdub-remove\fR(1)
